Preserved initial regression failure (before final test replay).

Commands:
  python -m unittest tests.test_wp84_r400_cumulant_endpoint_tensor
  python -O -m unittest tests.test_wp84_r400_cumulant_endpoint_tensor
  python -OO -m unittest tests.test_wp84_r400_cumulant_endpoint_tensor

All three runs reported 8 passing tests and one error in
test_exact_carrier_overlap_weighted_tensor_ledger_keeps_all_terms. The test
treated the ledger's boolean all_26_termwise_tensor_equalities field as a
sequence. The 26 row records are stored in physical_weighted_terms_checked;
